WEBVTT

00:25.520 --> 00:26.600
Hello there.

00:27.400 --> 00:28.680
My name is Nanno.

00:29.240 --> 00:30.440
I'm 16.

00:31.480 --> 00:33.320
Today is my first day.

00:33.400 --> 00:34.600
Please be kind.

00:36.360 --> 00:37.480
[Fong] From what I can remember,

00:37.560 --> 00:40.200
Nanno enrolled
in the middle of the semester.

00:40.280 --> 00:41.520
We tried to hang out with her,

00:41.600 --> 00:44.840
but she was always
on the phone with her boyfriend.

00:44.920 --> 00:47.120
[giggles]
Yes, Tan, yes.

00:47.200 --> 00:48.040
Yeah.

00:48.120 --> 00:49.760
You're always talking to your boyfriend.

00:49.840 --> 00:51.600
Don't you want to spend some time
with your friends?

00:52.760 --> 00:58.680
[Bell] Oh, wow. It's so big.
Tan must love her very much.

00:58.760 --> 01:01.800
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

01:04.000 --> 01:04.840
Should I look at her phone?

01:04.920 --> 01:05.760
CONTACTS

01:05.840 --> 01:06.680
-[Fong] Shit.
-[Bell] What is it?

01:06.760 --> 01:08.240
There's nothing here.

01:08.800 --> 01:10.760
[Proud] Nanno who was always on her phone,

01:10.840 --> 01:13.720
always chatting away, actually talking to…

01:13.800 --> 01:14.920
to no one.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.360
[screaming]

01:20.320 --> 01:22.280
PSYCHO BITCH
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

01:27.200 --> 01:29.640
It seems like she disappeared
after that day.

01:29.720 --> 01:31.200
[Nanno, on video] Hi, everyone.

01:33.360 --> 01:34.280
It's me, Nanno.

01:34.360 --> 01:35.880
Nanno, hey! Nanno.

01:35.960 --> 01:37.800
[Nanno] Nanno, hey! Nanno.

01:37.880 --> 01:38.960
It's me, Nanno.

01:39.640 --> 01:43.720
It's me, Nanno. Nanno, hey!
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.280
You remember Nanno now?

01:45.800 --> 01:46.640
Thap?

01:46.720 --> 01:49.400
I saw you were having a reunion,

01:49.880 --> 01:52.040
and I didn't wanna come empty-handed.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.400
Right, Tan?

01:55.840 --> 01:59.040
[Nanno, on video]
Nanno, hey. It's me, Nanno.

01:59.120 --> 02:01.760
Nanno, hey. It's me, Nanno.

02:01.840 --> 02:03.440
Nanno, hey. It's me, Nanno.

02:10.600 --> 02:13.240
[theme music]

03:27.040 --> 03:28.840
Why are you so quiet?

03:29.360 --> 03:31.680
Tan, don't you wanna talk
to me anymore, Tan?

03:37.320 --> 03:38.320
[Proud gasps]

03:45.360 --> 03:47.160
I really wanna meet Tan.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.800
[Proud]
We had to wait around for nothing again.

03:49.880 --> 03:53.360
Will I ever get to meet Tan
in this lifetime?

03:55.960 --> 03:58.000
I will go to the restroom.

04:04.200 --> 04:06.920
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

04:07.680 --> 04:08.560
Right?

04:10.760 --> 04:12.320
Should I look at her phone?

04:16.240 --> 04:17.880
CONTACTS

04:18.959 --> 04:19.839
CALL

04:19.920 --> 04:20.839
CALLING…

04:20.920 --> 04:22.400
[shushes]

04:22.480 --> 04:26.200
[line ringing]

04:28.120 --> 04:30.920
[Tan] Nanno, I can't talk right now.
I'm with Wit and the guys.

04:31.400 --> 04:33.120
Let's talk when we meet tonight, okay?

04:35.680 --> 04:37.160
Nanno?

04:37.240 --> 04:38.640
Is something wrong?

04:39.760 --> 04:41.120
Are you okay?

04:41.200 --> 04:43.600
Don't be mad.
Fong already suspects something.

04:53.560 --> 04:56.640
Was that really Thap's voice
we just heard?

04:56.720 --> 04:58.680
-[Proud] Are you deaf?
-[Bell] What?

04:58.760 --> 05:01.760
[Proud] If that wasn't Thap's voice
on the phone, then who the fuck was it?

05:01.840 --> 05:05.400
[Bell] What? I just wanted to make sure.
Did I do something wrong?

05:05.480 --> 05:06.720
Yes, you did.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.240
Can't you see Fong is devastated?
You're such a--

05:08.320 --> 05:10.000
Will you guys shut the fuck up?

05:18.600 --> 05:20.160
Let's fuck that bitch up.

05:21.160 --> 05:23.080
Yeah, yeah. Slut-slap her.

05:24.200 --> 05:25.480
If I were you,

05:26.200 --> 05:28.440
and she did that, I would kill her.

05:28.520 --> 05:29.360
Yeah.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.680
I'll make her wish she was dead.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.440
She'll pay.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.480
[Nanno] You wanna go for ice cream now?

05:45.680 --> 05:47.400
Tan is too busy,

05:48.520 --> 05:50.040
but I can go.

05:57.040 --> 05:58.320
Is…

05:59.320 --> 06:00.640
Is something wrong?

06:01.760 --> 06:03.400
Why are you acting weird?

06:04.080 --> 06:06.200
Don't worry about it. It's nothing.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.720
There's something we need to do.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.160
Oh, well. That's a shame.

06:14.360 --> 06:16.040
Let's go for ice cream next time.

06:16.120 --> 06:18.360
With or without Tan, yeah?

06:24.000 --> 06:25.680
Then, after that,

06:25.760 --> 06:29.560
Your pretty little angel
and my good, loyal friend, Fong,

06:30.120 --> 06:33.400
she spread a rumor all over school

06:33.480 --> 06:35.960
that I had an imaginary boyfriend.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.000
Isn't that right?

06:38.000 --> 06:39.640
You thought I didn't know that?

06:42.000 --> 06:44.000
Our thing ended a long time ago.

06:44.760 --> 06:46.160
What more do you want?

06:48.880 --> 06:50.840
How can our love affair

06:52.000 --> 06:53.480
possibly be over

06:54.280 --> 06:55.920
when I'm still in love with you?

07:02.800 --> 07:05.640
[Nanno] As soon as I became
the subject of the school's gossip,

07:06.240 --> 07:09.240
Tan permanently disappeared
from this world.

07:27.440 --> 07:29.440
[cell phone beeps]

07:29.520 --> 07:33.840
[Nanno] Until one day,
Tan changed his mind.

07:51.040 --> 07:53.120
[suspenseful music playing]

08:01.360 --> 08:04.000
NANNO. CAN WE MEET AT OUR SPOT?

08:37.280 --> 08:39.200
[somber music playing]

09:08.640 --> 09:09.880
[gasps]

09:09.960 --> 09:12.400
[Nanno] Help me. Help me.

09:12.480 --> 09:15.840
-[Thap breathing heavily]
-[Nanno] Tan, please, Tan.

09:18.400 --> 09:19.880
[footsteps approaching]

09:26.120 --> 09:27.320
What did you do?

09:29.400 --> 09:31.040
[Thap] Why did you have to do that?

09:31.640 --> 09:33.800
Why did you have to hurt her like that?

09:34.800 --> 09:36.480
What if you killed her?

09:37.920 --> 09:38.840
What if she died?

09:39.680 --> 09:42.080
[Thap] I can get in trouble for this.
Don't you understand?

09:44.040 --> 09:46.000
I can't do this anymore, Fong.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.200
I'm done, Fong.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.080
Thap.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.160
[clicks]

10:15.240 --> 10:16.160
Fong.

10:16.640 --> 10:18.480
[Thap] Don't, Fong!

10:19.480 --> 10:20.400
Fong.

10:26.920 --> 10:28.760
Stay. Please don't leave me.

10:33.000 --> 10:34.400
[Thap grunts]

11:08.640 --> 11:12.360
[giggles]

11:19.040 --> 11:21.160
That was the first time you cut yourself.

11:21.240 --> 11:24.240
The first cut you used
to tie yourself to Tan.

11:26.080 --> 11:30.400
I wonder how many you need,
how many cuts you need exactly

11:31.520 --> 11:33.600
to tie yourself to another person.

11:35.760 --> 11:39.880
Come to think of it.
If I had to choose between us,

11:39.960 --> 11:41.320
me or Fong,

11:42.000 --> 11:43.840
I'm not sure who's more of a psycho.

11:45.120 --> 11:47.080
[Nanno] You might have thought
that you won,

11:47.160 --> 11:49.840
but the fact that Tan is still with you,

11:50.840 --> 11:53.000
that he married you is what I wanted.

12:07.640 --> 12:09.000
Isn't that right, Tan?

12:10.880 --> 12:15.440
You're still with Fong
because you can't bring yourself to leave.

12:16.240 --> 12:20.160
You don't want to feel guilty,
so you have to stay.

12:22.160 --> 12:23.640
Isn't that what you told Proud?

12:27.760 --> 12:28.960
Right, Proud?

12:30.080 --> 12:32.600
Don't listen to her, Fong. She's lying.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.920
Fong, just put the pieces together.

12:36.440 --> 12:40.080
Why isn't it this age
is your pretty best friend still single?

12:40.920 --> 12:43.000
Just give it a little bit of thought.

12:44.440 --> 12:46.920
Proud is a flight attendant and…

12:47.680 --> 12:50.440
and Thap is a pilot.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.360
That's quite a coincidence.

12:54.600 --> 12:55.720
[keypad clacking]

13:20.000 --> 13:21.560
It's not what you think, Fong.

13:22.560 --> 13:24.640
We were on the same flight,
so Thap picked me up.

13:24.720 --> 13:26.720
It's not what you think, Fong.

13:26.800 --> 13:28.360
She would never do that to you.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.200
They were just on the same flight.

13:30.280 --> 13:31.520
[keypad clacking]

13:41.880 --> 13:43.640
[indistinct chatter]

13:43.720 --> 13:46.160
-[Wit] That's your friend, dude.
-[Bell] Oh, my god.

13:46.240 --> 13:47.640
[Meng] I can't do that.

13:48.680 --> 13:50.160
[Wit] That's bad.

13:51.680 --> 13:52.680
[Chai] Thap, you asshole.

13:58.800 --> 14:00.200
I finally caught you.

14:04.720 --> 14:06.080
Fong…

14:06.160 --> 14:08.640
That was a setup.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.160
You bitch!

14:11.240 --> 14:13.120
-[all] Hey.
-[Thap] Hey, Fong.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.840
-[Nanno] I also have a clip of…
-[Bell] Calm down, Fong.

14:14.920 --> 14:17.000
The two of them on bed later.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.560
Do you want to watch that, too?

14:18.640 --> 14:20.320
-[Thap] Fong.
-[Proud] Do you want to fight with me?

14:20.400 --> 14:21.880
-[Thap] Hey, calm down.
-[Fong] Let me go!

14:21.960 --> 14:22.920
Fong, enough.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.080
-[Fong] Let me go!
-Fong.

14:24.160 --> 14:27.120
Let me go! How can you do this to me?

14:27.200 --> 14:28.920
How can you do this to me?

14:29.000 --> 14:31.720
It's because you're like this!
This is why I have someone else.

14:36.680 --> 14:37.960
[Thap] Come on.

14:48.800 --> 14:49.920
Proud, are you all right?

14:50.760 --> 14:51.840
Get up carefully.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.440
Poor Fong.

15:00.160 --> 15:02.440
You even quit your job
to take care of him,

15:02.520 --> 15:03.440
and his house, didn't you?

15:04.080 --> 15:05.680
[Nanno] But in the end,

15:06.440 --> 15:10.680
what do you have to show
for all your troubles?

15:12.120 --> 15:14.120
[dramatic music playing]

15:31.960 --> 15:34.560
[clapping]
There she is.

15:34.640 --> 15:35.880
There's the Fong we remember.

16:01.200 --> 16:03.160
[all screaming]

16:03.240 --> 16:04.800
[Fong] How could you do that to me?

16:05.520 --> 16:06.880
-Fong, stop.
-Fong.

16:06.960 --> 16:07.880
Fong, stop.

16:07.960 --> 16:10.000
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

16:10.080 --> 16:13.560
[Fong] It's you! You're the one
who made me crazy!

16:13.640 --> 16:15.440
-[Fong yelling]
-[Thap] Ow!

16:16.120 --> 16:18.440
[Fong breathing heavily]

16:18.520 --> 16:21.120
-Are you fucking crazy, huh?
-[Fong shrieks]

16:31.480 --> 16:35.160
[foreboding music playing]

16:46.040 --> 16:47.000
Thap.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.640
You really shouldn't be so hard on her.

16:54.120 --> 16:57.520
[groaning]

17:00.080 --> 17:02.360
If you don't feel any sympathy for Fong,

17:03.480 --> 17:05.960
[Fong panting]

17:07.920 --> 17:10.079
you should feel sorry for your baby.

17:19.160 --> 17:20.800
[gasping]

17:20.880 --> 17:21.800
What?

17:22.280 --> 17:23.800
Fong didn't tell you?

17:24.599 --> 17:27.440
Fong has been pregnant
for over three months now.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.240
Fong!

17:29.320 --> 17:31.840
-Fong.
-[Fong groans]

17:33.440 --> 17:34.360
Fong.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.280
I'm sorry.

17:38.760 --> 17:40.560
I'm so sorry.

17:43.360 --> 17:45.120
Don't. Get off.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.560
Fong.

17:48.200 --> 17:51.000
You don't have to do anything
with him anymore, Thap.

17:52.280 --> 17:53.480
I'm so sorry.

17:57.400 --> 18:00.480
[Thap] Fong! Fong!

18:00.560 --> 18:02.560
Okay, Fong, take a deep breath.

18:02.640 --> 18:05.880
Fong, you're going to be okay, okay?
Fong, stay with me. Stay with me, Fong.

18:05.960 --> 18:08.720
[Kai] Take a deep breath. Fong! Fong!

18:08.800 --> 18:10.680
[Nanno] You guys really love each other.

18:11.280 --> 18:13.080
Our class is really the best.

18:18.480 --> 18:22.280
Of course, friendships
are so beautiful to see.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.600
Just like the old days, remember?

18:28.560 --> 18:30.920
[indistinct chatter]

18:37.480 --> 18:41.040
[Nanno] In high school,
you guys really had a good time with me.

18:41.640 --> 18:42.880
Isn't it weird?

18:42.960 --> 18:45.360
Everybody thinks they're good persons

18:45.440 --> 18:47.760
but when something like this happens,

18:47.840 --> 18:50.240
they have no problem…

18:59.840 --> 19:02.800
tearing someone else apart

19:02.880 --> 19:07.120
Everyone's looking for a target
to keep themselves entertained.

19:07.200 --> 19:10.400
[laughing]

19:12.280 --> 19:15.480
And that is who you all really are.

19:16.640 --> 19:21.360
Whenever someone everyone can hate,
your bond became even stronger.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.720
Don't you think that's interesting?

19:25.440 --> 19:28.600
I wonder how much
do you really love each other.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.960
[Shorty] What do you want, Nanno?

19:32.680 --> 19:33.600
Hmm.

19:35.080 --> 19:36.480
Now, the question is,

19:37.200 --> 19:39.560
"What exactly did I do to you all?"

19:43.200 --> 19:44.720
Bitch, did you spike our food?

19:45.560 --> 19:46.840
No.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.720
But I did spike your drinks.

19:49.800 --> 19:52.280
[somber music playing]

19:58.280 --> 20:01.360
The important thing about tonight is

20:01.440 --> 20:03.320
you will all be dead soon.

20:06.360 --> 20:08.920
-[vomiting]
-[all screaming]

20:09.000 --> 20:10.600
[giggles]

20:10.680 --> 20:16.000
[indistinct chatter]

20:16.080 --> 20:18.720
-[Nanno giggles]
-[crowd coughing]

20:18.800 --> 20:20.400
It's a shame, really.

20:20.880 --> 20:22.000
I only have one shot

20:22.880 --> 20:24.800
of the antidote.

20:27.120 --> 20:28.080
[grunts]

20:28.160 --> 20:29.920
[suspenseful music playing]

20:32.600 --> 20:33.640
[Meng] Give me that.

20:34.520 --> 20:36.040
[Shorty] Meng, help me.

20:36.120 --> 20:38.360
-I'm in pain, too, asshole.
-Fuck you, Meng.

20:42.240 --> 20:44.080
[Wit] Give me the goddamn antidote!

20:44.160 --> 20:46.560
[both grunting]

20:49.000 --> 20:49.960
Hey.

20:50.040 --> 20:50.920
-Hey!
-Hey!

20:54.360 --> 20:56.960
[suspenseful music intensifies]

21:00.920 --> 21:02.640
[glass breaks]

21:07.680 --> 21:08.640
[grunts]

21:27.800 --> 21:29.680
Come on, guys, calm down.

21:30.840 --> 21:32.400
[dreamy music playing]

22:51.200 --> 22:52.480
I did it.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.840
Congratulations, Chai.

22:55.920 --> 22:59.720
As of now, your blood has the antidote.

23:01.600 --> 23:02.960
[grunts]

23:03.040 --> 23:05.760
[Chai coughs, groans]

23:07.760 --> 23:08.880
I'm sorry, Chai.

23:09.480 --> 23:12.640
[Chai] Fuck you. I'll kill you!

23:12.720 --> 23:15.840
Guys, the antidote is in his blood.
It's in his blood. Come on.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.680
Hey, come help me kill him!

23:19.160 --> 23:20.280
Die!

23:21.400 --> 23:22.360
Just die already!

23:55.560 --> 23:56.560
Btu Kai.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.720
Do you think that will even work?

23:58.800 --> 24:00.200
I'm not sure,

24:01.160 --> 24:02.320
but we have to try.

24:07.840 --> 24:09.640
[dreamy music playing]

24:09.720 --> 24:11.320
[groaning]

24:16.840 --> 24:18.640
[sucking]

24:19.400 --> 24:20.800
[sucking]

24:39.320 --> 24:44.280
[Nanno laughing maniacally]

24:44.360 --> 24:45.520
Please stop.

24:46.560 --> 24:48.440
I'm sorry, guys,

24:48.520 --> 24:50.480
but I just couldn't help myself.

24:51.840 --> 24:55.080
I didn't put poison in your drink.

24:55.160 --> 24:56.680
I was just joking.

25:00.280 --> 25:03.520
What's the psychological term, hmm?

25:06.560 --> 25:09.160
I know. I'm a psycho.

25:10.720 --> 25:13.560
Nanno! Why the fuck would you do this?

25:14.680 --> 25:17.400
Well, come on.
Don't get mad at me, please.

25:17.480 --> 25:19.840
It was just a practical joke.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.720
I didn't even think you would believe me.

25:27.600 --> 25:29.120
-[Nanno] Hey.
-[Thap] Get Chai down.

25:29.960 --> 25:30.840
Sit.

25:33.600 --> 25:34.560
But…

25:35.440 --> 25:37.160
What are you guys going to do?

25:38.000 --> 25:39.760
I'll ask you again, you bitch.

25:39.840 --> 25:42.400
-Why did you do this?
-Hmm.

25:43.200 --> 25:45.480
Well, everyone just forgot about me.

25:45.560 --> 25:47.960
I just wanted you to remember.

25:48.040 --> 25:49.000
And now?

25:49.520 --> 25:51.360
Will you remember me now?

25:51.880 --> 25:53.080
[thuds]

25:57.480 --> 25:58.760
Now, Wit.

25:59.240 --> 26:01.040
Why didn't you tell me you liked it rough?

26:01.560 --> 26:03.400
I've always liked it rough, too.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.160
Why are you fucking with us?

26:05.880 --> 26:06.800
Nanno?

26:07.400 --> 26:08.680
I'm the bad guy?

26:09.800 --> 26:12.960
Aren't you the ones
who hurt and killed each other?

26:14.120 --> 26:15.880
You did that all by yourselves.

26:16.720 --> 26:18.960
[dramatic music playing]

26:19.520 --> 26:21.240
I didn't do anything to you.

26:22.800 --> 26:24.160
And you said you loved each other.

26:24.680 --> 26:27.120
[Nanno] Friends till the end.
[chuckles]

26:27.200 --> 26:33.960
[laughs maniacally]

26:36.520 --> 26:41.520
[Nanno] Hmm, I'm just the one
holding up from here.

26:49.320 --> 26:50.560
[Nanno grunting]

27:21.040 --> 27:23.120
[thudding]

27:24.680 --> 27:31.680
[Nanno laughing maniacally]

27:41.440 --> 27:42.600
[Nanno] One more thing.

27:42.680 --> 27:44.680
I'm not the one who poisoned you.

27:45.160 --> 27:46.920
I never told you to inject

27:47.800 --> 27:49.600
what was in the syringe

27:50.600 --> 27:53.480
or drink the blood of your friend,
you know?

27:54.480 --> 27:55.840
It is what it is.

28:10.280 --> 28:11.280
[Nanno] Hey.

28:12.760 --> 28:14.280
I want to thank you.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.080
If you all weren't my friends,

28:17.680 --> 28:19.480
I wouldn't have anyone to talk to.

28:45.160 --> 28:47.160
[somber music playing]

28:48.040 --> 28:49.120
PSYCHO BITCH

28:49.200 --> 28:50.560
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

28:52.040 --> 28:55.800
[Nanno] Many people think
that the time spent in school

28:55.880 --> 28:58.200
is the most happy time in their lives.

28:58.280 --> 29:00.920
We graduate in school,

29:01.000 --> 29:03.120
walk away with friendship

29:03.200 --> 29:05.320
and good memories in our hearts,

29:05.400 --> 29:07.160
and we go on with our lives.

29:07.880 --> 29:10.920
We grow up and think back with nostalgia,

29:11.000 --> 29:15.280
but graduation may not be the end
that you want it to be.

29:15.360 --> 29:18.240
It may be the beginning of something

29:18.320 --> 29:21.480
much, much scarier.

30:44.520 --> 30:45.840
Shit.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.200
I had a nightmare.

30:48.760 --> 30:50.640
It felt very real.

31:30.040 --> 31:34.240
[Nanno laughs maniacally]

32:01.320 --> 32:03.440
So, we should do this again next year.

32:29.560 --> 32:34.600
[Nanno] It was really fun, just like
everyone said it would be.

32:36.280 --> 32:38.960
[piano music playing]

32:44.320 --> 32:46.040
Life in high school is beautiful.

32:47.640 --> 32:50.200
Teachers are role models
for their students.

32:53.440 --> 32:55.560
They teach us right from wrong,

32:55.640 --> 32:57.640
and they tell us to apologize

32:57.720 --> 33:00.320
-so that we can making mistakes
-[breathing heavily]

33:00.400 --> 33:02.440
-that you just have to apologize for
-[screaming]

33:02.520 --> 33:03.560
again and again.

33:03.640 --> 33:04.760
Forgive us, Nanno.

33:05.240 --> 33:06.640
I'm sorry.

33:07.360 --> 33:08.720
You mean you're sorry again?

33:09.200 --> 33:10.120
[Nanno] It makes us realize

33:11.000 --> 33:13.520
that we have to do everything in our power

33:13.600 --> 33:16.080
to be better than everyone else,

33:16.160 --> 33:18.680
only to find out in the end

33:18.760 --> 33:20.600
that it wasn't worth it at all.

33:22.360 --> 33:26.440
It tells us that beauty
is the most important thing in our lives,

33:27.360 --> 33:29.280
and if we can't be more beautiful,

33:30.040 --> 33:31.840
then we should tear everyone else down

33:38.040 --> 33:40.560
It tells us that if we worship money,

33:40.640 --> 33:42.240
money will become more valuable

33:42.840 --> 33:46.040
It would be more valuable
than a human being.

33:50.120 --> 33:54.560
It tells us that even the weak can be evil

33:55.680 --> 33:56.960
if they're given power.

34:00.080 --> 34:03.280
And just like what everyone already knows,

34:03.360 --> 34:07.240
karma is the consequence of an action.

34:12.560 --> 34:14.159
[thuds]

34:14.239 --> 34:17.719
That's enough! Fuck! That's enough!

34:25.159 --> 34:28.080
[screaming]

34:32.320 --> 34:35.679
[screaming]

34:36.800 --> 34:38.360
[laughing maniacally]

34:38.440 --> 34:39.800
Open the door!

34:40.360 --> 34:41.560
Why won't it come off?

34:42.080 --> 34:43.280
Everyone!

34:44.679 --> 34:45.960
Where is everyone?

34:46.760 --> 34:47.600
Hello?

34:47.679 --> 34:49.360
I WISH EVERYONE WILL DISAPPEAR

34:50.080 --> 34:52.520
[crowd chanting]
Hanno.

34:52.600 --> 34:54.040
Hanno.

34:54.120 --> 34:55.639
Hanno.

34:55.719 --> 34:57.480
Hanno.

34:58.040 --> 34:59.600
Hanno.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.880
[gunshot]

35:12.520 --> 35:14.080
[Aum] I did it for everyone.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.400
Don't you see that?

35:16.480 --> 35:17.800
These people

35:18.680 --> 35:21.440
They're ruining the educational system
for all of us.

35:21.520 --> 35:23.080
I did the right thing.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.160
I did it for everyone.

35:33.360 --> 35:34.600
Next time,

35:34.680 --> 35:37.880
I might be the new student at your school.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.440
So, be prepared.

35:39.520 --> 35:40.840
See you soon.

35:41.880 --> 35:48.520
[laughing maniacally]

35:50.520 --> 35:52.920
[theme music]

36:56.480 --> 36:59.920
Subtitle translation by Danaya Olarikded
